§§ `Handling (s 22)`


`h receives` MEANS `Handling facts` WITH
    `the goods` IS `goods stolen in England`
    `it was done in the course of the stealing` IS FALSE
    `he knew or believed the goods were stolen goods` IS TRUE
    `dishonest in dealing with the goods` IS TRUE
    `he received the goods` IS TRUE
    `he undertook the retention, removal, disposal or realisation of the goods by or for the benefit of another person` IS FALSE
