`ad not a reward advertisement` MEANS `Reward advertisement facts` WITH
    `it is a public advertisement of a reward for the return of goods which have been stolen or lost` IS FALSE
    `it uses words to the effect that no questions will be asked` IS TRUE
    `it uses words to the effect that the person producing the goods will be safe from apprehension or inquiry` IS FALSE
    `it uses words to the effect that money paid for the purchase of the goods or advanced by way of loan on them will be repaid` IS FALSE
    `he advertised the reward` IS TRUE
    `he printed the advertisement` IS FALSE
    `he published the advertisement` IS FALSE
`ad no questions, but no part in it` MEANS `Reward advertisement facts` WITH
    `it is a public advertisement of a reward for the return of goods which have been stolen or lost` IS TRUE
    `it uses words to the effect that no questions will be asked` IS TRUE
    `it uses words to the effect that the person producing the goods will be safe from apprehension or inquiry` IS FALSE
