§ `Section 24`

#ASSERT `s 24 the goods are stolen goods` `goods stolen in England`
#ASSERT `s 24 the goods are stolen goods` `goods stolen abroad, an offence there`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 24 the goods are stolen goods` `goods taken abroad, no offence there`)
#ASSERT `s 24 the goods are stolen goods` `goods proceeds in the thief's hands`
#ASSERT `s 24 the goods are stolen goods` `goods proceeds in a handler's hands`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 24 the goods are stolen goods` `goods proceeds of something that was no offence`)
#ASSERT `s 24 the goods are stolen goods` `goods obtained by blackmail`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 24 the goods are stolen goods` `goods obtained by blackmail abroad, no offence there`)
#ASSERT `s 24 the goods are stolen goods` `goods obtained by fraud`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 24 the goods are stolen goods` `goods obtained by something that is no fraud offence`)
#ASSERT `s 24 the goods are stolen goods` `money withdrawn from the credit`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 24 the goods are stolen goods` `money withdrawn but not from the credit`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 24 the goods are stolen goods` `goods of some other origin`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 24 the goods are stolen goods` `goods that are land not severed by stealing`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 34(2)(b) the thing is goods` `goods that are land not severed by stealing`)
#ASSERT `s 34(2)(b) the thing is goods` `goods stolen in England`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 24 the goods are stolen goods` `goods restored to the owner`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 24 the goods are stolen goods` `goods the owner has no right to`)
#ASSERT `s 24(3) the goods have ceased to be stolen goods` `goods restored to the owner`
#ASSERT `s 24(3) the goods have ceased to be stolen goods` `goods the owner has no right to`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 24(3) the goods have ceased to be stolen goods` `goods stolen in England`)

